In short: use it for anything that is not commercial, including modifying it and
sharing your changes.  Selling it, or selling something built on it, needs a
separate licence from the copyright holder.

The same applies to `apps/common/ckt/`, `apps/cktbench/`, `apps/tubebench/`,
`tools/tube_render.c`, `tools/tube_live.c` and the two host tests that exercise
them.  `tools/nam.c` and its neighbours are NOT covered: those are a port of
Apache-2.0 work by other people and stay Apache-2.0.
